 ball girl and then I played  with her that was obviously huge for me  and we both managed to play in the  national team together it's really a  crazy story I have to say she was always  my role model I think the best player is  Marta what she brings to the field with  her technique and dynamics is really  top-notch you've won a lot of awards now  the World Cup is coming up yes how do  you feel about that is that the title  that's still missing you know to missing  teeth  yes of course that's a title that's  still missing you think this put inside  but I think we have potential as a team  we were a unit on and off the pitch and  you can see that you can feel it too  I think that's a very important factor  where should women's football be in 20  years what are your hopes  just wish we get more attention and the  more games would be shown on TV and  perhaps the Bundesliga did you know that  all the Swedish women's league matches  were shown live on TV this year I didn't  know that but it's great what do you  look forward to most in the tournament  in a tournament you have to be in top  form you can't let yourself slip up I'd  say that's not pressure but rather  motivation it depends I'm looking  forward to it the best thing would be if  it started tomorrow long nosed game
 

